      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PLATOON (8) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 4 lengths at Ballarat in a handy 22.20 beating Rachel. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Form reads well for this. MYSTIC LULU (3) hit the ground running last time with a fast early split and never headed, leading throughout to win by 2.75 lengths (22.46) over 390m at this track. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. PAW QUADE (1) had the drop on the lead and went on to be beaten 4 lengths into third (24.83) at Sale in a Grade 5 over 435m. Winning chance. TRIMBOLE (2) was strongly fancied last time but finished second (26.00), beaten 6 lengths. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win.",
